						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<h2 class="bb_tag" >STORY:</h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Worm adventure continues in new part. Now Worm mission is to collect stars in this winter themed land. Winter land is full of traps like spikes and rotating traps. Player worm need find 8 stars to collect steam achievements in this third person adventure walking game. Use checkpoints as if player dies he respawn to latest checkpoint area. So can you avoid all traps and find all hidden stars</p><h2 class="bb_tag" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class="bb_ul"><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Open world which is full of rotating objects and platforms</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Winter themed land</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Collect 8 stars to get steam achievements</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >Checkpoints</p></li><li><p class="bb_paragraph" >3rd person short platformer and simulation game</p></li></ul>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
